**Who this is for:** Any agent scheduling **video Reels/Shorts** or building **still graphics from reel plates** for ML Social.

**Source:** Spencer Office Hours **#00b** (2026-08-21, `ee7Q8-Wptxc`) — full scrub: `sacredground-maintenance/reel-building/sources/00b-ee7Q8-Wptxc.THREE-PASS-SCRUB.md`.  
