## The spine (do not stop at Social)

Spencer’s **one desk** model:

| Step | Engine | Your job here |
|------|--------|----------------|
| **P** | Persona | Clip + locked cast; extract **stills** from KEEP takes |
| **S** | **Social** | **This rule** — publish short-form with continuity |
| **M** | Mail + CRM | Hand off to email agent after a strong post (see email rule) |
| **F** | Fernando / Junior | Talk outcomes; human keeps taste on final mile |

**Hard line:** Social is **step 2**, not the finish line. Content must not **die on the feed** — email/CRM follows (separate rule).

