## Stills from reels (how to make them)

### When to use a still vs the video

| Use | When |
|-----|------|
| **Video** (`video/mp4`) | Reel / Short / TikTok / primary episode publish |
| **Still from same KEEP clip** | Thumbnail, email hero (email rule), Story teaser, “guess what happens” posts |

### Extracting the still (Persona / Media Library)

- Use Persona clip builder: scrub timeline → **extract frame** → **set as featured / thumbnail**.
- Or: open KEEP MP4 in Media Library → pick the frame that matches the hook (faces readable, no mid-blink).
- **PNG overlays** for sharp shop words (event title, CTA) — **do not** rely on AI baked-in typography (Spencer: words need designed PNGs).

### Visual energy (Sacred Ground)

- Colorful, bright, shop-made — not generic mystic AI sludge.
- Reel **stills for shop posts** still follow `social-image-branding.mdc` when you add footer/logo overlays (cream band, `shopsacredground.com`, `847-749-3922`).

